                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for S Buisson &amp;lt;sbuisson@ddn.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/80b7628a-4552-49d8-94c2-fa95aa8236c5" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/80b7628a-4552-49d8-94c2-fa95aa8236c5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_405 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;One layout swap locked test failed
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Issue happened during subtest 57:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Starting test test57 at 1590189089
swap_lock_test: cannot get group lock: Input/output error (5)
swap_lock_test: swap_lock_test.c:1237: test57: assertion 'rc == 0' failed: cannot lock 'foo1': Input/output error
 sanity test_405: @@@@@@ FAIL: One layout swap locked test failed 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the client logs, it appears that it was evicted by several OSTs, and we see multiple occurrences of this message:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;[16601.763992] LustreError: 25518:0:(sec_gss.c:2118:gss_svc_verify_request()) phase 0: discard replayed req: seq 8
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;





&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
